## 💻 Software Inference

The software inference pipeline:

- Loads the trained model
- Processes degraded PNG images
- Generates enhanced outputs
- Saves results automatically

### Input Directory

```text
testing_images/degraded/
```

### Output Directory

```text
output/
```

### Model File

```text
models/best_model_arch1.pth
```

